    "Regular -AR verb, no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Often used reflexively: **matarse** (to kill oneself, or figuratively \"to work oneself to death\")",
    "Related noun: **el asesinato** (murder, more formal), **la matanza** (slaughter/massacre)",
